  "qualification_limits": [
    "Intel Core i9-13900H Linux KVM with CET disabled; other CPU models, faults and asynchronous events remain unqualified.",
    "Native APIs guarantee named inputs and abandon the compiler frame. They do not reconstruct an original-image full register/vector context or provide asynchronous unwind across the stack switch.",
    "NeverD ordinary transfer-proof boundaries are unchanged; this phase changes NeverD documentation only.",
    "NeverC stage-1 and selected x86 regressions pass; this is not a full product CI or stage-2 qualification.",
    "SYSENTER, IRET/RETF, RSM, FRED/UIRET native APIs and the other global support-table gaps remain open."
  ],
